        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International GTB, Beaded Base Grab Bars</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nJust because something is utilitarian, does not mean that it has to look like it. The bead design on the mounts of this grab bar along with the beautiful finish choices add classic glamor to a normally solely functional item. The Beaded Grab Bar is available in polished brass, polished chrome, satin nickel, and oil rubbed bronze finishes. Choose the size that fits your needs with lengths ranging from 12 inches to 42 inches. It comes packaged with all the necessary mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the RK International Beaded Base Grab Bar:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 6 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTB-1</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 14-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTB-2</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 20-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTB-3</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 26-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTB-4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 32-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTB-5</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 38-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>RKI-GTB-6</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 42\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 44-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Tubing Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
